  "description": "ONEVEL crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 2/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C112 H254 Er4 O49 Si28. From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.365-4.761 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.94-178.41°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C112H254Er4O49Si28. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
